---

<Layout
  title="Residential Carpet & Stair Cleaning | Montreal & South Shore"
  description="Wall-to-wall carpet and stair cleaning at home with steam, shampooing and green products. Serving Montreal and the South Shore."
>
  <!-- SPLIT SCREEN HERO -->
