          <div class="problem-statement fade-in-up delay-100">
            <h2 class="problem-title">Professional Carpet Cleaning with Green and Eco-Friendly Products</h2>
            <p class="problem-text">
              Everyday foot traffic leaves residential carpets and carpeted stairs exposed to dust, dirt, pet hair and embedded soil. Urine stains, persistent odours and heavily soiled areas may also require specialized treatments.
            </p>
            <p class="problem-text">
              At Groupe Nettoyage Empire, we prioritize green and eco-friendly professional cleaning products selected according to the carpet fibres and their condition.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="lead-text fade-in-up delay-200">
            We provide <strong>residential carpet cleaning</strong> at home for <strong>wall-to-wall carpet</strong>, bedrooms, basements, hallways and <strong>carpeted stairs</strong>. After a <strong>pre-service inspection</strong>, we adapt the method with steam carpet cleaning, carpet shampooing and hot-water extraction when the fibres allow. Specialized treatments may be recommended and applied only with your approval.
          </p>

          </div>

          <div class="service-hero-action-band">

          <ConversionCtaPriorityGroup locale="en" buttonStyle="green" phoneIcon estimateIcon />
          <ServiceVideoProof
            title="See Our Carpet Cleaning in Action"
            subtitle="Complete residential carpet cleaning at home"
            description="Watch a real in-home carpet cleaning and see our professional method for deep cleaning residential carpets."
            youtubeId="9TKQuGP6-GA"
            youtubeTitle="Complete Residential Carpet Cleaning at Home"
