  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="service-layout">
        <div class="service-main">
          <div class="fade-in-section delay-100">
            <h2 class="section-title text-gradient-empire">
              Our five-step professional method
            </h2>

            <p>
              Every visit starts with the real condition of the carpet. Here is the typical flow of professional residential carpet cleaning at home:
            </p>

            <ul class="benefit-list" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
              <li>
                <strong>1. Pre-service carpet and fibre inspection:</strong> we assess the carpet, fibres, wear, stains and odours, then explain the recommended method.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>2. Preparation and professional vacuuming:</strong> surface preparation, floor protection when needed, and vacuuming to remove dust and dry soil.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>3. Specialized pre-treatments when needed:</strong> when inspection warrants it, an enzyme, oxygen-based or other suitable pre-treatment—always after explanation and with your approval. Timing follows product characteristics and manufacturer guidance.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>4. Professional steam carpet cleaning, shampooing and hot-water extraction:</strong> a coordinated process adapted to the fibres, to lift soil and remove excess moisture. Steam alone is not automatic disinfection of every carpet.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>5. Rinsing, final extraction, finishing and drying guidance:</strong> we complete the process and advise on drying. Drying generally takes a few hours, depending on fibres, humidity and ventilation.
              </li>
            </ul>

            <h3 style="color: var(--color-primary); margin: 2rem 0 1rem; font-size: 1.35rem;">
              Wall-to-wall carpet: living rooms, bedrooms, basements and hallways
            </h3>
            <p>
              We provide <strong>wall-to-wall carpet cleaning</strong> for living rooms, bedrooms, basements and hallways. The method adapts to fibre type and soil level for high-traffic areas and everyday residential use.
            </p>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
              This page focuses on <strong>fixed residential carpets</strong> and <strong>carpeted stairs</strong>. For removable area rugs, see our
              <a href="/en/services/tapis-synthetique/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">synthetic carpet cleaning</a>,
              <a href="/en/services/tapis-laine/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">wool carpet cleaning</a>
              and
              <a href="/en/services/tapis-orientaux/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">oriental rug cleaning</a>.
              For offices and businesses:
              <a href="/en/services/nettoyage-tapis-commercial/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">commercial carpet cleaning</a>.
            </p>

            <div style="margin-top: 3rem; background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px;">
              <h3 style="color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                Specialty: carpeted stair cleaning, treads and landings
              </h3>
              <p>
                <strong>Carpeted stair cleaning</strong> needs a different approach from an open living-room area. Stair treads, noses, risers and landings soil quickly under frequent traffic—this service covers carpeted stairs, not wood or ceramic stair cleaning.
              </p>
              <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
                After inspection, our technicians use <strong>professional extraction tools</strong> suited to each step and landing corner. We treat heavily used areas to lift embedded soil and traffic marks, and restore pile volume where possible.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 3rem;">
              <hr class="separator" />
              <h3 style="color: var(--color-primary);">Truck-mounted and portable professional equipment</h3>
              <p>
                We prioritize <strong>truck-mounted carpet cleaning equipment</strong> for steam cleaning and professional hot-water extraction when access allows.
              </p>
              <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
                For high-rise buildings, condos or difficult access, we use <strong>portable carpet extraction equipment</strong>. Equipment choice depends on access, fibre type and site conditions—portable units provide professional extraction when a truck-mount is not appropriate.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
              <h3 style="color: var(--color-primary);">Stains, odours, dust mites and allergens</h3>
              <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                Depending on the inspection, residential carpet cleaning can address several common situations:
              </p>
              <ul class="benefit-list" style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
                <li><strong>Human and pet urine stains:</strong> related stains and odours, often addressed with an enzymatic pre-treatment or another specialty treatment based on the assessment.</li>
                <li><strong>Pet odours and persistent odours:</strong> targeted treatment when the source can be treated on site.</li>
                <li><strong>Food stains, embedded soil and high-traffic areas:</strong> an approach adapted to heavily used lanes.</li>
                <li><strong>Dust, dust mites and allergens:</strong> deep cleaning helps remove dust and residue present in the fibres.</li>
                <li><strong>Bacteria and specialized disinfectant treatments:</strong> when appropriate and fibre-compatible, a disinfectant treatment may be recommended as a complement—it is not automatic.</li>
              </ul>
              <p>
                Enzyme treatments, oxygen-based treatments or disinfectant treatments are presented clearly (recommended, needed based on the assessment, or optional). The technician explains the recommendations and obtains your <strong>authorization</strong> before any application. These specialty treatments are not automatically included in the base clean and are not all presented as eco-friendly.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
              <h3 style="color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 10px;">
                Carpet stain protection
              </h3>
              <p>
                After inspection, a fibre-compatible <a href="/en/services/protecteur" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">professional stain protector</a> may be offered, especially for stairs and high-traffic areas. It helps slow liquid absorption in daily use, without absolute protection.
              </p>
            </div>

            <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
              On the South Shore, see also our local pages:
              <a href="/en/services/nettoyage-tapis-longueuil/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">carpet cleaning in Longueuil</a>,
              <a href="/en/services/nettoyage-tapis-brossard/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">Brossard</a>,
              <a href="/en/services/nettoyage-tapis-boucherville/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">Boucherville</a>,
              <a href="/en/services/nettoyage-tapis-chambly/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">Chambly</a>
              and
              <a href="/en/services/nettoyage-tapis-candiac/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">Candiac</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="service-layout" style="display: block;">
        <div class="service-main" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
          <div class="fade-in-section delay-200" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
            <h2 class="section-title text-gradient-empire">
              Why choose us?
            </h2>
            <div class="benefits-grid">
              <div class="benefit-item">
                <div class="check-circle" aria-hidden="true"><UiIcon name="check" size={14} /></div>
                <span>More than 30 years of experience</span>
              </div>
              <div class="benefit-item">
                <div class="check-circle" aria-hidden="true"><UiIcon name="check" size={14} /></div>
                <span>Green and eco-friendly professional products</span>
              </div>
              <div class="benefit-item">
                <div class="check-circle" aria-hidden="true"><UiIcon name="check" size={14} /></div>
                <span>Truck-mount or portable, based on access</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p style="margin-top: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-text-main);">
              Pre-service inspection, fibre-adapted methods and professional in-home service: our team brings more than 30 years of experience to residential carpet and carpeted stair cleaning.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="zones-section" style="margin-top: 3rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
            <h3 style="color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.4rem;">Service Areas — Carpet Cleaning</h3>
            <p>We provide in-home service across Greater Montreal, Laval and the South Shore with our mobile units.</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
              For area-focused carpet cleaning, see our page on <a href="/en/services/nettoyage-tapis-montreal/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">carpet cleaning in Montreal</a> and, for the city of Westmount, <a href="/en/services/nettoyage-tapis-westmount/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">carpet cleaning in Westmount</a>.
            </p>

            <div class="city-group">
              <p class="city-lead">Montreal (East and West)</p>
              <div class="badges-container">
                <span class="badge badge-blue">Montreal (all boroughs)</span>
                <span class="badge badge-blue">Westmount</span>
                <span class="badge badge-blue">Mount Royal</span>
                <span class="badge badge-blue">Outremont</span>
                <span class="badge badge-blue">LaSalle</span>
                <span class="badge badge-blue">And more...</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="city-group">
              <p class="city-lead">Laval</p>
              <div class="badges-container">
                <span class="badge badge-blue">Laval (entire city)</span>
                <span class="badge badge-blue">Chomedey</span>
                <span class="badge badge-blue">Sainte-Rose</span>
                <span class="badge badge-blue">Vimont</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="city-group">
              <p class="city-lead">Montreal South Shore</p>
              <div class="badges-container">
                <span class="badge badge-green">Longueuil</span>
                <span class="badge badge-green">Brossard</span>
                <span class="badge badge-green">Saint-Lambert</span>
                <span class="badge badge-green">Saint-Hubert</span>
                <span class="badge badge-green">Greenfield Park</span>
                <span class="badge badge-green">Saint-Bruno</span>
                <span class="badge badge-green">Boucherville</span>
                <span class="badge badge-green">And more...</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <p class="contact-footer">Need a quick appointment? Call us at <strong>(514) 893-9939</strong>.</p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="fade-in-section delay-200"
            style="margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; background: #f8fbff; border: 1px solid #c5dff0; border-radius: 8px; max-width: 800px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"
          >
            <h3 style="color: var(--color-primary); margin: 0 0 0.75rem; font-size: 1.2rem;">
              Residential carpet cleaning pricing
            </h3>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-text-main); font-size: 0.98rem;">
              Carpet cleaning price depends on area, fibre type, carpet condition and treatments recommended on site. For a before-tax indication, use our online instant estimate. Minimum order: $169 — travel included. Some areas may be subject to a different minimum charge. Current promotions can also be reviewed on our <a href="/en/promotions/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">Promotions page</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="fade-in-section delay-300" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
            <h2 class="section-title text-gradient-empire">
              Frequently asked questions — residential carpet cleaning
            </h2>
            <FAQSchema
              faqs={[
                {
                  question: "What do steam carpet cleaning, shampooing and hot-water extraction involve?",
                  answer: "After fibre inspection, we use suitable products, carpet shampooing and steam cleaning with hot-water extraction when the textile allows. This approach removes soil and excess moisture more thoroughly than a consumer machine. Steam alone is not automatic disinfection.",
                },
                {
                  question: "Do you clean carpeted stairs, treads and landings?",
                  answer: "Yes. Our carpeted stair cleaning covers treads, noses, risers and landings with professional extraction tools. This service is for carpeted stairs, not wood or ceramic stair cleaning. Pricing reflects the number of steps and the staircase layout.",
                },
                {
                  question: "Do you use truck-mounted or portable equipment?",
                  answer: "We prioritize truck-mounted carpet cleaning equipment when access allows. For condos, some upper floors or difficult access, we use portable professional extraction equipment. Both options provide professional extraction; the choice depends on access, fibres and on-site conditions.",
                },
                {
                  question: "Do you treat urine stains and pet odours?",
                  answer: "Yes, that is a common request. After inspection, the technician may recommend an enzymatic pre-treatment or another specialty treatment, then proceed with cleaning and extraction. Every additional treatment is explained and applied only with your authorization. Results depend on how old and how deep the stain is.",
                },
                {
                  question: "Does cleaning help with dust mites, allergens and bacteria?",
                  answer: "Deep cleaning helps remove dust, soil and residue associated with allergens in the fibres. When appropriate, a disinfectant treatment compatible with the textile may be offered as a complement. Steam alone is not automatic disinfection of every carpet.",
                },
                {
                  question: "Are enzyme, oxygen-based or disinfectant treatments included?",
                  answer: "They are not automatic. Depending on the inspection, they may serve as a pre-treatment or a complementary step. The technician explains what is recommended, needed based on the assessment, or optional, then obtains your authorization before any application.",
                },
                {
                  question: "How long does the carpet take to dry?",
                  answer: "Drying generally takes a few hours, depending on fibres, room humidity and ventilation. After extraction, the surface is typically slightly damp, not soaked. Good airflow speeds the process.",
                },
                {
                  question: "Do you use green and eco-friendly cleaning products?",
                  answer: "We prioritize green and eco-friendly professional cleaning products selected according to the carpet fibres and their condition. Specialty treatments (enzyme, oxygen-based or disinfectant) are distinct from the base clean and chosen according to the needs of the visit.",
                },
              ]}
            />
          </div>

          <p
            class="fade-in-section"
            style="margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-text-main); font-size: 0.95rem;"
          >
            Also useful:
            <a href="/en/services/meubles-tissu/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px;">fabric furniture cleaning</a>,
            <a href="/en/services/nettoyage-desinfection-matelas/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px;">mattress cleaning and disinfection</a>,
            <a href="/en/produits" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px;">professional products</a>
            and our
            <a href="/en/video-gallery/" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px;">video gallery</a>.
          </p>

          <div
            class="fade-in-section delay-200"
            style="margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; background: #f8fbff; border: 1px solid #c5dff0; border-radius: 8px; max-width: 800px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"
          >
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-text-main); font-size: 0.98rem;">
              <strong>Maintenance products:</strong> for stubborn odours or light spot care between visits, see our
              <a href="/en/produits" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">professional products</a>
              (odor neutralizer, enzymatic spot cleaner) — the same types of solutions we use with our clients.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
